1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,890
Everyone wants their order on Saturday.

2
00:00:03,043 --> 00:00:05,851
But your kitchen only
has room for twenty.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,408
So let customers pick the day,

4
00:00:10,508 --> 00:00:12,288
and let Pickday keep count.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,720
Shoppers choose a day and a time slot,

6
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:19,900
right in your cart, cart
drawer or product page.

7
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:20,950
Local delivery,

8
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:22,738
store pickup or shipping.

9
00:00:22,788 --> 00:00:25,087
Only the days you're open can be picked.

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,650
You decide how many orders fit in a day,

11
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,370
or in each time slot.

12
00:00:30,475 --> 00:00:33,022
When it's full, it closes. By itself.

13
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,334
Add cut-off times.

14
00:00:36,354 --> 00:00:37,783
Preparation time.

15
00:00:37,803 --> 00:00:39,145
Delivery areas.

16
00:00:39,165 --> 00:00:41,810
Public holidays that
come back every year.

17
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,530
Even a vacation mode.

18
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,020
At checkout, customers only
see the option they picked,

19
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,120
with their date.

20
00:00:49,274 --> 00:00:51,012
No date? No order.

21
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:55,996
Behind the counter, every
order lands on its day.

22
00:00:56,096 --> 00:00:57,876
Move orders in a few clicks,

23
00:00:57,896 --> 00:01:00,146
or let customers change their own date,

24
00:01:00,166 --> 00:01:01,935
up to a deadline you set.

25
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,590
Every morning, print a day sheet,

26
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:07,790
a route sheet or a production list.

27
00:01:07,894 --> 00:01:09,694
And get tomorrow's orders by email,

28
00:01:09,714 --> 00:01:11,970
free, with Shopify Flow.

29
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,430
Pickday speaks your customers' language.

30
00:01:16,583 --> 00:01:18,013
Right to left, too.

31
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:24,260
It works on every Shopify plan,

32
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:26,181
with no theme code to touch.

33
00:01:26,201 --> 00:01:27,560
Set up in minutes.

34
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,410
Pickday.

35
00:01:30,619 --> 00:01:32,499
Let customers pick the day.

36
00:01:32,652 --> 00:01:34,922
Find it on the Shopify App Store.
